[agent:result]         4→
[agent:result]         5→This notebook computes the `distance_deg` and `score` features for scoring requests.
[agent:result]         6→
[agent:result]         7→---
[agent:result]         8→
[agent:result]         9→## Step 1: Load Data
[agent:result]        10→
[agent:result]        11→Load the requests and profiles data from the local `data/` directory.
[agent:result]        12→
[agent:result]        13→```python
[agent:result]        14→requests_df = spark.read.csv("/data/requests.csv", header=True, inferSchema=True)
