[agent:result]        41→        sqrt(
[agent:result]        42→            (col("request_lat") - col("home_lat")) ** 2 + 
[agent:result]        43→            (col("request_lon") - col("home_lon")) ** 2
[agent:result]        44→        ),
[agent:result]        45→        6
[agent:result]        46→    )
[agent:result]        47→)
[agent:result]        48→
[agent:result]        49→# Compute score
[agent:result]        50→joined_df = joined_df.withColumn(
[agent:result]        51→    "score",
[agent:result]        52→    round(col("base_score") - 0.1 * col("distance_deg"), 6)
[agent:result]        53→)
[agent:result]        54→```
